WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.390
I wish...

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.074
Advertise your product or brand here
contact www.OpenSubtitles.org today

3
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.120
I wish I had another chance.

4
00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.920
A hospital?

5
00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.050
My arm.

6
00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:50.060
My leg's fine. too.

7
00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:54.520
The hole in my chest
is also healed up.

8
00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:58.110
So was that just a nightmare?

9
00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:03.570
Oh. good.
Glad. you're already awake.

10
00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:06.330
Who're you?

11
00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:11.030
Hunter's Association Surveillance
Team manager. Jinchul Woo.

12
00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:12.530
And I'm Taeshik Kang.

13
00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.070
Okay. but...

14
00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:16.010
what do you want with me?

15
00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.450
Before that. let's get
your doctor in here.

16
00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:51.840
What?

17
00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:55.600
So you're telling me I was
unconscious for three whole days?

18
00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:59.020
What about Joohee and Mister Song?
They're okay too. right?

19
00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.060
Yes. but...

20
00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:06.110
Chiyul Song lost an arm. which would
present a challenge for any hunter.

21
00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:08.570
so he may retire.

22
00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:12.910
Joohee Lee was deeply traumatized
and is receiving psychiatric care.

23
00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:17.730
Given her condition. I suspect
she'll resign soon as well.

24
00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:29.050
Of the thirteen hunters who raided
that dungeon. just six of you lived.

25
00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.590
Only six.

26
00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:36.730
Though we all know how dangerous hunting
is. it's rare to see such a tragic end.

27
00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:40.310
And yet it gets even more unusual.

28
00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:44.020
When the White Tiger Guild
arrived on the scene.

29
00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:48.910
after being alerted by the survivors.
all they found was you.

30
00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:54.650
The temple they'd been
told about had disappeared.

31
00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:56.790
No trace of any statues either.

32
00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.870
There was just
you collapsed on the ground.

33
00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:00.080
No way.

34
00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:02.670
It's quite hard to believe.

35
00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:07.550
There were no inconsistencies
between their reports. however.

36
00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:11.170
Not to mention we also recovered
the remains of the deceased.

37
00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.930
Thus. we're much less
suspicious of your party.

38
00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:17.430
Incidentally.

39
00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:20.640
And this is just speculation.
of course. but...

40
00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:23.890
Hunter Jinwoo Sung.

41
00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:27.820
by chance. did you experience
a second awakening?

42
00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.200
A second awakening?

43
00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:37.240
Once a hunter's power manifests.
it doesn't change.

44
00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:38.740
They get what they get.

45
00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:43.450
Unless. that is. they have
a rare "second awakening".

46
00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:47.960
It lets them exceed their limits
and rise to A or sometimes S-Rank.

47
00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.630
Maybe I could. too!

48
00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:53.210
This is a mana meter.

49
00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:55.350
Place your hand on the stone. please.

50
00:04:57.010 --> 00:05:00.260
If they really encountered
instakill-level magic beasts.

51
00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:04.300
there's no way an average hunter would
have made it out of that situation alive.

52
00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:07.310
And for those beasts to vanish
along with their dungeon suggests

53
00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:11.020
the presence of an A
or even S-Rank hunter.

54
00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:14.400
Making a second awakening
the most likely explanation.

55
00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.620
Well. sir? What rank does
the mana meter say I am now?

56
00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:27.290
Apologies. It would appear
that we were mistaken about you.

57
00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:28.710
Huh?

58
00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:32.380
Even E-Ranks typically
get higher than 70.

59
00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:34.590
He's basically just a civilian.

60
00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:38.760
The dungeon disappeared
and can't be explored again.

61
00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:42.050
so how did he manage to survive?

62
00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:45.140
Well. that sucks.
Went and got my hopes up.

63
00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.600
I wonder. though.

64
00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:51.250
Why'd they leave without
asking about this screen?

65
00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:56.290
But. then again.
maybe they couldn't see it.

66
00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.540
Guess it's not a touch panel.

67
00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:18.810
This first popped up in that dungeon.

68
00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.850
Jinah!

69
00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.230
You have got to take
better care of yourself!

70
00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.310
You know how worried
I've been about you?

71
00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:28.520
I'm sorry.

72
00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:30.810
Other hunters
are as healthy as can be.

73
00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:33.560
But all of your raids
end up with you getting hurt!

74
00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.400
My anxiety's through the roof!

75
00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:38.700
To think I was prepared
to leave her behind.

76
00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.200
What's with the smile?

77
00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:42.240
This is serious because
next time something

78
00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:44.070
like this happens
I'm dropping out of school.

79
00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.250
I'm gonna find a job.
so you can quit yours!

80
00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:48.370
Message officially received.

81
00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.000
And speaking of.
do you see this thing?

82
00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:53.660
-What thing?
-Uh. never mind.

83
00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:59.090
Okay like. you know how video games
sometimes notify you about stuff?

84
00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.630
Random tangent?

85
00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:03.010
How would you open
one of those messages?

86
00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:05.230
I'll go tell the doc
you need a neuro exam.

87
00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:07.890
Come on. didn't you
used to be a gamer?

88
00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:12.140
Yeah. I did. but don't all
unchecked messages go to an inbox?

89
00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:14.400
Oh. right. Gotta open the inbox.

90
00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:20.320
-Why suddenly bring up games?
-N-Not much to do in a hospital.

91
00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.570
I remember this "Player" stuff
being mentioned before.

92
00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:28.790
Well. you seem to be doing pretty okay.
so I'll be on my way. See you later.

93
00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:33.040
Okay. Ready when you are. Song-yi.

94
00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:38.170
"This system is designed to
assist the development of the Player.

95
00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:41.420
Failure to comply with the
system may result in a penalty.

96
00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.540
The rewards have been delivered."

97
00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:46.970
I have no idea
what any of this means.

98
00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:50.680
Huh? "Daily Quest:
Strength Training has arrived."

99
00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.150
Uh. confirm.

100
00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:56.480
Let's see. "Push-ups.
sit-ups. squats. running.

101
00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:59.940
Failure to complete the daily quest
will result in an appropriate penalty."

102
00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:01.900
What the...

103
00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:03.360
Yeah. okay.

104
00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:05.710
If this is a joke.
it's not a very good one.

105
00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:09.870
Hospital patients don't exactly
have that energy to spare.

106
00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:13.080
What in the world is going on?

107
00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.840
Hello. Chairman Go.

108
00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:20.300
We spoke with hunter Jinwoo Sung
at the hospital. and we were wrong.

109
00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:21.880
I see.

110
00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:25.140
We're lucky this incident
didn't result in a dungeon break.

111
00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:28.810
But at the same time. it leaves
too many unanswered questions.

112
00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:30.010
Agreed.

113
00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:32.890
It's an unprecedented case.
to be sure.

114
00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:36.440
No shortage of mysteries
when it comes to dungeons.

115
00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:42.110
Let's mark this as a special case and enter
it into the databank. for further evaluation.

116
00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:43.860
Yes. right away.

117
00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:48.620
Gonna be a long day.

118
00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:56.210
For the next B-Rank raid.
what would you say to taking on

119
00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:58.420
an instructor role for us. Miss Cha?

120
00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.420
An instructor? But why?

121
00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:04.840
Well. this raid will serve as a test for
our new recruits. so I want you there.

122
00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:05.930
If you're up to it.

123
00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:09.140
I don't know how great
of a mentor I would be.

124
00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:12.180
Fight as you usually do and
treat this raid as any other.

125
00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.350
They can learn just
by seeing how you work.

126
00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:17.570
Which is a true testament
to how talented you are.

127
00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:20.730
Our guild is one of the five
largest in the country.

128
00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.940
but we fall short
on an international scale.

129
00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:26.570
Meaning that there's some
room for improvement.

130
00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:30.320
Though I realize it sounds contrary.
our joint strength can increase

131
00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:32.500
even if we as individuals can't.

132
00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:36.380
Best to prepare.
No telling what's ahead.

133
00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:45.010
Another gate.

134
00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:50.180
Of course. it's in the
middle of the damn road.

135
00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:51.680
I hope they can clear it soon.

136
00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:54.180
Right? They should have
been here by now.

137
00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:09.790
Wha..?! Is that an earthquake?

138
00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.840
What the...

139
00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:23.670
How'd I get here?
I'm dreaming. right?

140
00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:26.810
I mean. I was just
in the hospital. and then.

141
00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:38.110
Come on. You're kidding.

142
00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.700
Wait.

143
00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:48.240
Is something wrong?

144
00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.410
Where'd the patient
from this room go?

145
00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:10.300
How many of them are there?

146
00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:16.730
Two more hours might
just kill me anyway!

147
00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:19.430
-Any sign of him?
-No. None.

148
00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:22.020
Maybe we just missed him
and he's back in his room now.

149
00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:23.270
Let's check.

150
00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:26.030
I seriously doubt he left
the hospital at this hour.

151
00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.200
I can't keep on running forever!

152
00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:57.970
A penalty.

153
00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.730
Quest?

154
00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.630
He's here!

155
00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:07.700
Mister Sung! Are you all right?

156
00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:13.190
Yep. Nearly healed now.

157
00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:15.910
I should be able
to leave pretty soon.

158
00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:18.120
I'm glad to hear it.
So where you gonna take me?

159
00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:21.140
After all the stress you put me through.
you totally owe me. big time.

160
00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.830
Yeah. yeah. Talk to you later.

161
00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:27.550
All right. Time to go.

162
00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:31.750
You want me to help with a raid?

163
00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:32.880
Yeah.

164
00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:37.140
A D-Rank gate appeared on a road in
Hop-jung. and all the guilds are tied up

165
00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.310
with other obligations at the moment.

166
00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.810
But it's fine if you'd rather not.

167
00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:46.440
What you went through was horrible.
and that's totally understandable.

168
00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:49.190
-I'm so sorry.
-Nah. don't apologize.

169
00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:50.690
Oh. that reminds me.

170
00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:53.570
I heard Hunter Sung
woke up and is doing great.

171
00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:55.570
Jinwoo is doing okay?

172
00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:04.990
He lived after everything.

173
00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:06.720
That's wonderful!

174
00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:13.250
-Look. there he goes again.
-Sheesh.

175
00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:16.480
He's been running laps every
day since he first woke up.

176
00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:20.300
But his leg...

177
00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:24.300
I know hunters recover a lot faster
than normal people. but still...

178
00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.860
He says he's trying
to get back into shape.

179
00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:29.270
I've told him to take it easy.
but does he listen?

180
00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:31.110
Acts like he was never injured.

181
00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:32.900
Such a handful.

182
00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:37.030
In the four days since I
regained consciousness.

183
00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:39.530
I've figured out a few things.

184
00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:43.660
To start. these screens
are not hallucinations.

185
00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:47.330
When I complete the daily quest.
I receive three types of rewards.

186
00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.170
Full recovery activate.

187
00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:53.170
And just like that.
my fatigue is gone.

188
00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.640
I also get ability points.

189
00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:59.760
They boost my stats and I can
divide them up however I want.

190
00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:02.560
so I've been beefing up my strength.

191
00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.520
My power grows with each upgrade.

192
00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:08.190
I can literally feel
the difference in my muscles.

193
00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:12.310
Oh. yeah. and I've got these
skill and inventory screens. too.

194
00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:16.040
As weird as the world's become.
mine somehow got even weirder.

195
00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.820
Really it's like a game!

196
00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:20.620
Oh. um...

197
00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:30.210
And my final daily quest reward:
the random loot box.

198
00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:32.000
What will it be today?

199
00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:41.220
Ooh.

200
00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.300
Figured it'd be more
bandages. pens.

201
00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.100
or other useless stuff
like I've been getting.

202
00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:52.070
An "instance dungeon"?
What is that?

203
00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:58.280
Well. based on everything else. it's
sure to help me get stronger somehow.

204
00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:05.070
And now a report on
today's gate conditions.

205
00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:09.290
New D-Rank gates have appeared
at these locations. as you can see.

206
00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:12.000
And the C-Rank gates in the
Upper East and Midtown areas

207
00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.040
are currently being neutralized.

208
00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:17.880
The B-Rank gate that popped up in
the wharf district is yet to be dealt with.

209
00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:19.420
The Hunters Guild
is scheduled to raid it

210
00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.590
within the next few days.
but steer clear until they do.

211
00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:26.310
Avoiding the traffic caused by the gates
will save you both frustration and time.

212
00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:30.230
Now for more detailed information
let's take a look at a couple of graphs.

213
00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:32.730
As you'll note. we've had
some big dips and spikes.

214
00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.980
but nothing abnormal to report.

215
00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:44.740
Mom!

216
00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:47.620
-Mom. you've gotta wake up!
-What's wrong with her?

217
00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:50.830
I-I don't know.
She's not responding at all!

218
00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.450
Eternal Sleep Disease?

219
00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:56.960
Yes. "Final Rest" is
another term for it.

220
00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:00.210
An illness that came into existence
with the appearance of the gates.

221
00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:03.300
It affects one in every
ten thousand people or so.

222
00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:07.970
It's not proven yet. but it's theorized
the cause is incessant exposure to mana.

223
00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:12.400
Until we know more. life support is
the best modern medicine can offer her.

224
00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:15.690
Let's see some hustle!

225
00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:17.440
Put your back into it!

226
00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:19.280
Right!

227
00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:32.330
Congratulations.

228
00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:35.370
You're qualified to be
a hunter. Mister Sung.

229
00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:38.340
We look forward to seeing
what you're capable of.

230
00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.630
See? This is it!

231
00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.710
Now we can pay for Mom's treatment!

232
00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:46.140
But it's dangerous.

233
00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:49.440
I'll be okay.
You have my word on that!

234
00:16:58.150 --> 00:16:59.270
The heck are you doing?

235
00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.690
Go park it in a corner
somewhere and don't move!

236
00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:04.950
Psh. Damned E-Rank.
slowing us down.

237
00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:11.830
And for the record. the only ones who
get a cut are the ones who put in work!

238
00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:15.620
Yeah. of course. Sorry. I suck.

239
00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:21.470
I'll put my ability points
into strength.

240
00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.140
Got all my gear ready.

241
00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:36.400
Did everything
that needed to be done.

242
00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.770
And hey. I'm the king
of running away.

243
00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:42.940
If it gets as bad as last time.
I'll bolt out of there.

244
00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:10.680
Huh.

245
00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:27.290
Hey! Wait!

246
00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:31.120
Why's the exit blocked off here?

247
00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:38.710
I get it.

248
00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:41.040
I stepped into a different dimension.

249
00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:44.500
So. instance dungeons
aren't like the regular kind.

250
00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.590
I bet they're closer to red gates.

251
00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:49.510
though it's not like
I've been in one to compare.

252
00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:53.970
Man. what a mess. Great.
so much for my exit strategy.

253
00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:56.230
I was really counting on that. too.

254
00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:59.690
A what stone?

255
00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:03.690
So then. if I don't clear the dungeon.
I'll stay trapped in here.

256
00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:06.860
All E-Rank beasts
wipe the floor with me.

257
00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:09.490
but I'm supposed
to solo this whole thing.

258
00:19:09.570 --> 00:19:11.030
Awesome.

259
00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:17.160
With no help from anyone else.
can I really beat a boss?

260
00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:20.040
I guess it's time to find out.

261
00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:34.390
Okay. All my confidence is gone.

262
00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:42.020
Three on one? Right off the bat?

263
00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:35.200
I got one.

264
00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:56.930
I...

265
00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:58.940
I'm stronger now.

266
00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:11.610
A wolf.

267
00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:13.490
Much more challenging.

268
00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:18.250
It's tougher than the goblins.
I can sense it.

269
00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:24.040
My legs won't move!

270
00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:26.300
Why?

271
00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:28.840
Am I that afraid?

272
00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:31.720
I thought I was over what happened.

273
00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.340
No!

274
00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:44.970
I don't have a healer.

275
00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:47.150
So no second chances.

276
00:21:48.305 --> 00:22:48.606
